## Upstream notices

This repository integrates derivative material from two upstream projects.
Their copyright notices are reproduced here as required by the MIT License.

### AKOÚŌ — https://github.com/sonicfieldlabs/akouo

MIT License

Copyright (c) 2026 akoúō contributors

AKOÚŌ is authored by emeisazam (eme), a non-binary designer and developer
from the global south, published under Sonic Field Labs. The listening
modes, claim taxonomies, schemas, commands, presets, and listening-covenant
concept used in this repository originate with that project.

### MASA — https://github.com/sonicfieldlabs/MASA

MIT License

Copyright (c) 2026 Sonic Field Labs

The Sound Matter Aware protocol (v0.1.0) is a project-agnostic contract
for describing, listening to, measuring, transforming, and exchanging
sound as matter. The adapter in `src/masa_adapter.py` maps AKOÚŌ outputs
into MASA records; it is a mapping, not a claim of equivalence.
